# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Changes to `generate_preset_pass_manager` interface {#changes-to-generate-"
"preset-pass-manager-interface}"
msgstr ""
"Modificări ale interfeței `generate_preset_pass_manager` {#changes-to-"
"generate-preset-pass-manager-interface}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 includes a series of updates to the preset pass manager interface (that is, the\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) and\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile) functions) that affect the\n"
"handling of loose constraint inputs, such as `coupling_map` or `basis_gates`. The number of\n"
"transpilation use cases where loose constraints are accepted has been reduced in favor of the\n"
"`target` and `backend` inputs (where `backend` is a [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) that\n"
"contains a [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) instance),\n"
"which allow for a more expressive communication of these constraints.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit v2.0.0 include o serie de actualizări ale interfeței Transpiler-ului preset (adică funcțiile\n"
"[`generate_preset_pass_manager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.generate_preset_pass_manager) și\n"
"[`transpile`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/compiler#transpile)) care afectează\n"
"gestionarea intrărilor de constrângeri libere, cum ar fi `coupling_map` sau `basis_gates`. Numărul de\n"
"cazuri de utilizare a transpilării în care sunt acceptate constrângerile libere a fost redus în favoarea intrărilor\n"
"`target` și `backend` (unde `backend` este un [`BackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.BackendV2) care\n"
"conține o instanță [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target)),\n"
"care permit o comunicare mai expresivă a acestor constrângeri.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples show the main changes and suggested alternatives for migrating. Note that all\n"
"of the migration tips below apply to both `transpile` and `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"
msgstr ""
"Exemplele de mai jos prezintă principalele modificări și alternativele sugerate pentru migrare. Reține că toate\n"
"sfaturile de migrare de mai jos se aplică atât pentru `transpile`, cât și pentru `generate_preset_pass_manager`:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The `backend_properties` input argument is no longer supported, and the `BackendProperties` class has\n"
"been removed. You should use the `target` or `backend` arguments instead to communicate\n"
"gate durations and errors. There are multiple paths for constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target):\n"
msgstr ""
"Argumentul de intrare `backend_properties` nu mai este suportat, iar clasa `BackendProperties` a fost\n"
"eliminată. Ar trebui să folosești argumentele `target` sau `backend` în schimb pentru a comunica\n"
"duratele și erorile Gate-urilor. Există mai multe căi pentru construirea unui [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) personalizat:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  a. Build a target from scratch and add the relevant errors and durations "
"to the corresponding gates:\n"
msgstr ""
"  a. Construiește un Target de la zero și adaugă erorile și duratele "
"relevante la poartă-urile corespunzătoare:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import (\n"
"    Target, InstructionProperties, generate_preset_pass_manager)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"
msgstr "    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate, CXGate\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target(num_qubits=2)\n"
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"    CXGate(), {(0, 1): InstructionProperties(error=.0001, duration=5e-7)})\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"    target.add_instruction(\n"
"        XGate(),\n"
"        {\n"
"            (0,): InstructionProperties(error=.00001, duration=5e-8),\n"
"            (1,): InstructionProperties(error=.00002, duration=6e-8)\n"
"        }\n"
"    )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  b. Use [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) to quickly build a\n"
"     generic target with pre-filled errors and durations. These can also be updated post-construction:\n"
msgstr ""
"  b. Folosește [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2) pentru a construi rapid un\n"
"     Target generic cu erori și durate precompletate. Acestea pot fi, de asemenea, actualizate după construire:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.providers.fake_provider import GenericBackendV2\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import generate_preset_pass_manager\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = GenericBackendV2(num_qubits=2, basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"]).target\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (0,), InstructionProperties(0.00001))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"x\", (1,), InstructionProperties(0.00002))\n"
"    target.update_instruction_properties(\"cx\", (0, 1), InstructionProperties(0.0001))\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"2. The `instruction_durations` and `timing_constraints` input arguments are no longer supported. You should use the\n"
"  `target` or `backend` arguments instead. The alternatives are constructing a custom [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) from\n"
"  scratch, constructing a generic backend, and, in addition to these, it is possible to build a custom target with\n"
"  `instruction_durations` and/or `timing_constraints` using the `Target.from_configuration` method:\n"
msgstr ""
"2. Argumentele de intrare `instruction_durations` și `timing_constraints` nu mai sunt suportate. Ar trebui să folosești\n"
"  argumentele `target` sau `backend` în schimb. Alternativele sunt construirea unui [`Target`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target) personalizat de la\n"
"  zero, construirea unui Backend generic și, în plus față de acestea, este posibil să construiești un Target personalizat cu\n"
"  `instruction_durations` și/sau `timing_constraints` folosind metoda `Target.from_configuration`:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler import Target, generate_preset_pass_manager\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.timing_constraints import TimingConstraints\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.instruction_durations import InstructionDurations\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"
msgstr ""
"    instruction_durations = InstructionDurations(\n"
"      [(\"x\", None, 200), (\"cx\", None, 1000)], dt=1e-7)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"
msgstr ""
"    timing_constraints = TimingConstraints(\n"
"            granularity=1, min_length=1, pulse_alignment=1, acquire_alignment=1\n"
"        )\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"
msgstr ""
"    target = Target.from_configuration(num_qubits=2,\n"
"                                      basis_gates=[\"x\", \"cx\"],\n"
"                                      instruction_durations=instruction_durations,\n"
"                                      timing_constraints=timing_constraints)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"3. Providing `coupling_map` and/or `basis_gates` along with a `backend` is discouraged, and from\n"
"  v2.0 a `UserWarning` will be raised. In these cases there are multiple sources of truth,\n"
"  and information such as gate errors and durations from the backend cannot be resolved based on the\n"
"  information given.\n"
"  The suggested alternative is to define a custom target that combines the chosen constraints either\n"
"  from scratch, using [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) or [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"
msgstr ""
"3. Furnizarea `coupling_map` și/sau `basis_gates` împreună cu un `backend` este descurajată și, începând cu\n"
"  v2.0, va fi generată o `UserWarning`. În aceste cazuri există mai multe surse de adevăr,\n"
"  iar informații precum erorile și duratele Gate-urilor din Backend nu pot fi rezolvate pe baza\n"
"  informațiilor furnizate.\n"
"  Alternativa sugerată este să definești un Target personalizat care combină constrângerile alese fie\n"
"  de la zero, folosind [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration) sau [`GenericBackendV2`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.providers.fake_provider.GenericBackendV2).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"4. The `basis_gates` argument no longer accepts custom basis gates. The suggested alternative\n"
"  is the `target` argument, which can be built from scratch or through [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  such as:\n"
msgstr ""
"4. Argumentul `basis_gates` nu mai acceptă Gate-uri de bază personalizate. Alternativa sugerată\n"
"  este argumentul `target`, care poate fi construit de la zero sau prin [`Target.from_configuration`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.Target#from_configuration)\n"
"  astfel:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"    from qiskit.circuit.library import XGate\n"
"    from qiskit.transpiler.target import Target\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    basis_gates = [\"my_x\", \"cx\"]\n"
"    custom_name_mapping = {\"my_x\": XGate()}\n"
"    target = Target.from_configuration(\n"
"        basis_gates=basis_gates, num_qubits=2, \n"
"        custom_name_mapping=custom_name_mapping\n"
"    )\n"
"    pm = generate_preset_pass_manager(target=target)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"5. The input combination where a custom `coupling_map` is provided with either a `backend` or `basis_gates`\n"
"  that contain gates with three or more qubits is no longer allowed. The coupling map\n"
"  does not provide the necessary connectivity details to be able to determine the  action of the gate.\n"
"  In these cases, the recommended migration path is the creation of a custom target from scratch.\n"
msgstr ""
"5. Combinația de intrare în care un `coupling_map` personalizat este furnizat împreună cu un `backend` sau `basis_gates`\n"
"  care conțin Gate-uri cu trei sau mai mulți Qubiți nu mai este permisă. Harta de cuplare\n"
"  nu furnizează detaliile de conectivitate necesare pentru a putea determina acțiunea Gate-ului.\n"
"  În aceste cazuri, calea de migrare recomandată este crearea unui Target personalizat de la zero.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"6. The `inst_map` argument has been removed without alternative. It was used to provide pulse information\n"
"  to the transpiler, and the full `qiskit.pulse` module has been removed.\n"
msgstr ""
"6. Argumentul `inst_map` a fost eliminat fără alternativă. Era folosit pentru a furniza informații despre pulsuri\n"
"  Transpiler-ului, iar modulul complet `qiskit.pulse` a fost eliminat.\n"

